   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Set for planting seedlings. Flower pot with soil, small shovel, sprouted bulb and mock-up sign for inscription plant names on light yellow background. Top view, flat lay, space for text.</rdf:li>
